      "content": "i've been working in the digital archives at the university library for a long time, but lately i'm seeing something really strange. it's not just typos or bad OCR... it's like certain specific words or ways of describing autonomy are just... slipping away. they're being replaced by these much more sterile, neutral terms in the newer metadata layers. i'm trying to keep a log of these disappearances before they're totally scrubbed from the search indexes. can you help me look for patterns in how certain concepts are being diluted or phased out?",
